-- the electric energy at the vertex with charge labels ns on its edges, as root-sum terms, in units of
-- −α m_p N_v/(2ℓ_p³) and the volume operator's own unit: Σ_{e,e′} n_e n_e′ O_ee′
electric-terms : List Nat → List Triple → List SQ → List Term
electric-terms ds ts ns = electric-terms-w ds ts ns (vw-of ds ts)
